t=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Piece_of_Darkest_Chocolate\" title=\"Item:Piece of Darkest Chocolate\">Piece of Darkest Chocolate</a></b>, obtained in the <a href=\"/page/The_Night_Revels_-_Delera%27s_Graveyard\" title=\"The Night Revels - Delera&#39;s Graveyard\">Crypt</a>, in <a href=\"/page/Category:Challenges_in_Night_Revels_Crypt\" title=\"Category:Challenges in Night Revels Crypt\">any challenge</a>, and via <a href=\"/page/Item:Draught_of_Midnight\" title=\"Item:Draught of Midnight\">Draught of Midnight</a></span></span><b>40</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Spooky_Almond\" title=\"Item:Spooky Almond\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/IngIcon_SpookyAlmond.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span> <span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Spooky_Almond\" title=\"Item:Spooky Almond\">Spooky Almond</a></b>, obtained in <a href=\"/page/The_Kobolds%27_Newest_Ringleader\" title=\"The Kobolds&#39; Newest Ringleader\">The Kobolds' Newest Ringleader</a>, <a href=\"/page/Under_New_Ravagement\" title=\"Under New Ravagement\">Under New Ravagement</a></span></span><b>20</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Black_Apple\" title=\"Item:Black Apple\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/IngIcon_BlackApple.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span> <span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Black_Apple\" title=\"Item:Black Apple\">Black Apple</a></b>, obtained in <a href=\"/page/Grave_Work\" title=\"Grave Work\">Grave Work</a>, <a href=\"/page/Smashing_Pumpkins\" title=\"Smashing Pumpkins\">Smashing Pumpkins</a></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Nightshield\" title=\"Nightshield\">Nightshield</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Nightshield\" title=\"Nightshield\">Nightshield</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 8<br /><b>Charges: </b>2 (2/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 2 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:2)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Nullification\" title=\"Nullification\">Nullification +66</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Nullification\" title=\"Nullification\">Nullification +66</a>:</b> Passive: +66 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Negative (Necrotic) and Poison <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Void Lore IV</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Void Lore IV</a>:</b> Passive: Your Negative Energy and Poison spells gain a 14% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#Improved_False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">Improved False Life</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/False_Life_(enchantment)#Improved_False_Life\" title=\"False Life (enchantment)\">Improved False Life</a>:</b> This item grants the wearer +20 maximum <a href=\"/page/Hit_point\" title=\"Hit point\">health</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus\" title=\"Spell Focus\"> Necromancy Focus I</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus\" title=\"Spell Focus\"> Necromancy Focus I</a>:</b> +1 Equipment bonus to the DC of Necromancy spells.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Docent_of_Shadow_(level_12).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Docent_of_Shadow_%28level_12%29.png/420px-Docent_of_Shadow_%28level_12%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"598\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Docent_of_Shadow_%28level_12%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Joe_Candymaker\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Joe Candymaker\">Joe Candymaker</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Docent_of_Shadow_(level_16)\" title=\"Item:Docent of Shadow (level 16)\">Docent of Shadow (level 16)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>This docent is as dark as the night sky and almost seems to crawl visibly with moving shadows. It boosts the power of its wearer's negative energy magic, and grants a measure of necromantic protection against enemy attacks.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#